description=Shared UI framework for Neat mods, providing reusable interface components, styling, and compatibility support across supported B42 builds. <LINE> Build Support: B42.0.2 to B42.20.2+. <LINE> Linux dedicated server compatibility: Lua file paths and line endings remain normalized to reduce the chance of checksum issues on case-sensitive servers. <LINE> B42.20.2 MP/server animation media scan compatibility: empty animation/actiongroup media folders are provided because this framework does not ship custom animation files.